{"version":1,"content":"<p>一顆本應被膨脹恆星吞噬的紅矮星，竟與兩顆已耗盡燃料的白矮星共同構成一個罕見的三星系統。國際天文學家團隊在距地球僅28光年處發現這一奇特結構，並將其命名為「Welopōʻai」。研究團隊表示，該系統的存在仍缺乏令人信服的形成解釋，相關成果已發表於《天文學與天體物理學》。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1587906.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T06:23:55.422962+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T06:07:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T06:17:14.180336+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T06:17:14.180336+00:00","content_hash":"d560b7cc6aef4ac82a2205341fd9a3f5f7e4d287194eda00dc4f4b8e258ef687","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}